  "details": "Can we please have a microphone sensitivity slider kinda like how discord has? Me and my best friend play vrchat constantly, but my microphone on my headset sucks, and it's really quiet so I have to talk SUPER loud for anything to be heard. My best friend on the other hand has a very quiet voice so when she talks normally the mic cuts in and out. And I noticed in this new update that the microphone sensitivity was cut down a bit, which is fine if there was a slider but there isn't so you pleased the people with loud backgrounds but not the people with quiet voices or microphones and now it's annoying for me to play and impossible for my friend to play. Please add a microphone sensitivity slider, please",
